[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    58[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 1. the `int` return value, and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    59[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 2. everything written to **stdout** (captured by redirecting fd 1 around each
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    60[0m:[38;5;10m[49m    call, then `fflush(NULL)`).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    61[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
