[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    218[0m:[38;5;10m[49m fn c14_sequential_calls_stream_order() {
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    219[0m:[38;5;10m[49m     // Many calls inside a SINGLE capture window: verifies the byte stream
